+<lb xml:id="W0002-00-0014-lb-0021"/>Christiana, tan prouechosa, y agradable fructa. <choice><abbr>Por<g ref="#chare0303">ẽ</g>de</abbr><expan resp="#CB" cert="high">Porende</expan></choice> su<lb xml:id="W0002-00-0014-lb-0022" break="no" rendition="#hyphen"/>plico muy <choice><abbr>humilm<g ref="#chare0303">ẽ</g>te</abbr><expan resp="#CB" cert="high">humilmente</expan></choice> a. V. A. <choice><abbr><g ref="#charq0303">q̃</g></abbr><expan resp="#CB" cert="high">que</expan></choice> poniendo los ojos mas en
+<lb xml:id="W0002-00-0014-lb-0023"/>vuestra soberana humanidad, <choice><abbr><g ref="#charq0303">q̃</g></abbr><expan resp="#CB" cert="high">que</expan></choice> en su pareja <choice><abbr>gr<g ref="#chara0304">ā</g>deza</abbr><expan resp="#CB" cert="high">grandeza</expan></choice>, con la
